{"id":"food-rabbit","name":{"en":"Food Rabbit","ja":"食料ウサギ"},"desc":{"en":"This rabbit has been selectively bred as livestock, so the meat in its entire body is delicious. Its horns and pelt are also useful for daily life, and are not thrown away. They sometimes escape and turn wild.","ja":"家畜として、全身の肉がおいしくいただけるよう、品種改良されたウサギ。角や毛皮も日々の生活に役立ち、捨てるところがない。たまに脱走して野生化している"},"race":{"en":"Animal","ja":"動物"},"hp":111,"atk":57,"defen":14,"spd":44,"level":3,"exp":3,"cole":1,"locations":[{"id":"lush-valley","name":{"en":"Lush Valley","ja":"豊かの谷"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"woods-of-eternal-night","name":{"en":"Woods of Eternal Night","ja":"常夜林道"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"fertile-sea-eastern-area","name":{"en":"Fertile Sea - Eastern Area","ja":"豊饒の海・東部"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"},{"id":"fertile-sea","name":{"en":"Fertile Sea","ja":"豊饒の海"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"},{"id":"fertile-sea-northern-area","name":{"en":"Fertile Sea - Northern Area","ja":"豊饒の海・北部"},"parent":"stellard-southern-archipelago"}],"drops":[{"id":"rabbit-fur","name":{"en":"Rabbit Fur","ja":"ウサギ毛"}}],"kind":"animal","index":109}